{"id": 692, "date": "2026-02-07T12:00:00", "date_gmt": "2026-02-07T03:00:00", "guid": {"rendered": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/?p=692"}, "modified": "2026-02-14T18:42:41", "modified_gmt": "2026-02-14T09:42:41", "slug": "2%e6%9c%8814%e6%97%a5%e5%9c%9f%e3%81%8b%e3%81%90%e3%82%84%e3%81%ae3d%e3%82%92%e3%81%8a%e6%8a%ab%e9%9c%b2%e7%9b%ae%e6%b1%ba%e5%ae%9a%ef%bc%81sanrio-virtual-festival-%e3%81%ab%e7%99%bb%e5%a0%b4", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/692/", "title": {"rendered": "2月14日(土)かぐやの3Dをお披露目決定！Sanrio Virtual Festival に登場"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p>Sanrio Virtual Festival 開催期間限定イベントとして、ゲーミングPCをお持ちの方は、「CHILL PARK」にて、かぐやのパフォーマンスをお楽しみいただけます！</p>\n<p data-uid=\"7cSlz8Rs\" data-time=\"1769751430006\">かぐやの元気いっぱいなステージパフォーマンスをぜひお楽しみください！</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-693\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/6b31352f812b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"995\" height=\"673\" srcset=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/6b31352f812b.png 300w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/7c53c6fba0ce.png 1536w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/8fd34a8bee1b.png 768w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/21715faa9520.png 1024w, https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/umaimann/cpk_gh@main/site/ext/303a943af653.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 995px) 100vw, 995px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>【披露楽曲】</strong><br />\n「私は、わたしの事が好き。– HoneyWorks / かぐや(cv.夏吉ゆうこ) from 超かぐや姫！」</p>\n<p><strong>【パフォーマンス時間】</strong><br />\n1回目：2/14(土) 12:00～<br />\n2回目：2/15(日) 12:00～、18:00〜<br />\n3回目：3/1(土) 18:00～<br />\n4回目：3/7(土) 12:00～<br />\n5回目：3/8(日) 12:00～</p>\n<p>▽Virtual Sanrio Puroland公式サイトもご確認ください。<br />\n<a href=\"https://v-puroland.sanrio.co.jp/contents/kaguya\">https://v-puroland.sanrio.co.jp/contents/kaguya</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>Sanrio Virtual Festival 開催期間限定イベントとして、ゲーミングPCをお持ちの方は、「CHILL PARK」にて、かぐやのパフォーマンスをお楽しみいただけます！ かぐやの元気いっぱいなステージパフォ [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 8, "featured_media": 0, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"_acf_changed": false, "footnotes": ""}, "categories": [1], "tags": [], "class_list": ["post-692", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "hentry", "category-uncategorized"], "acf": [], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/692", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts"}], "about": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/post"}], "author": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/users/8"}], "replies": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/comments?post=692"}], "version-history": [{"count": 3, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/692/revisions"}], "predecessor-version": [{"id": 731, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/692/revisions/731"}], "wp:attachment": [{"href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=692"}], "wp:term": [{"taxonomy": "category", "embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/categories?post=692"}, {"taxonomy": "post_tag", "embeddable": true, "href": "https://www.news.cho-kaguyahime.com/wp-json/wp/v2/tags?post=692"}], "curies": [{"name": "wp", "href": "https://api.w.org/{rel}", "templated": true}]}}